{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0584_1000_p", "source_sha256": "45002b80ef41c4a7d2956d7fb70fd0c8ac223b61882b258677ba01c83685d6b6", "ja": "（今日は、学園異能バトルドラマの撮影だ。真と瑞希の\n凸凹エージェントコンビが、敵を調査している……）", "zh": "（今天是校园异能战斗剧的拍摄。真和瑞希这对性格迥异的特工搭档，正在调查敌人……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0584_1001_006mak", "source_sha256": "b5ce5e5c78a97b8e6378634bba01574099822617d145944da442301e95df056c", "ja": "もらってきたよ、『ヘリオトロープタイムズ』。", "zh": "我拿到了，《向日葵时报》。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0584_1002_006mak", "source_sha256": "7ae9b648d9e2230c1d4513b3525c413069a00fff6722f43fd47367a404ffcd56", "ja": "ま、簡単に尻尾は出さないか。あーあ、早く戦いたい\nな～。瑞希が相手してくれてもいいけど？　へへっ。", "zh": "嘛，看来没那么容易露出马脚啊。唉～好想快点开打\n啊～。瑞希来当我的对手也行哦？嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0584_1003_null", "source_sha256": "a1269628ae1a31b7c3027a5c36e0f5ec7f2b4dcc51bd33ce7866202fe4c2df78", "ja": "休憩中……", "zh": "休息中……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0584_1004_p", "source_sha256": "d5531b388de5f0d517db71323072f3eb994aa011fdc6cf67babd11b92fe59f32", "ja": "真、もうすぐ撮影が……って、あれ？　いないな。\nここに居るって聞いたんだけど……。", "zh": "真，马上就要开始拍摄了……咦？不在啊。\n我听说在这里的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0584_1005_006mak", "source_sha256": "fb1302b23c6e6556353b65e06bc56ad5b7eafc90e0a8294a8e8fa648c464ac90", "ja": "はぁ、ふぅ……あ、{$P$}！\nどうしたんですか？", "zh": "哈啊，呼……啊，{$P$}！\n怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0584_1006_p", "source_sha256": "3d6c4828c64010d7119d833e41907d1bd26fb5bd074bd02c9e47be8811651873", "ja": "ああ。真の出番が近付いてきたから、呼びにきたんだ。\n真こそ、どこかに行ってたのか？", "zh": "啊，真快要上场了，所以我过来叫你。倒是你，刚才去哪儿了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0584_1007_006mak", "source_sha256": "38e4b82cd5a9cd8350ae3ccd9762ee88b1aa285b2acbfef4988192fe48abafe3", "ja": "はい！　ちょっと体を動かしてたんです。\nいい演技をするためには、体は冷やせませんから！", "zh": "是！我刚才稍微活动了一下身体。\n想要演好戏，身体可不能冷下来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0584_1008_p", "source_sha256": "c25949341f0c8dd144a0ea8b0ce97e5cbe1ca109d2e4ad5f14a3505f79e1593d", "ja": "おお、気合い入ってるな！　頼もしいよ。", "zh": "哦，很有干劲嘛！真是可靠啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0584_1009_006mak", "source_sha256": "5c939bfe69a3d99527f98d1cd5f8b228bf3b499b7e820a8b6b43ab9f636eb2ea", "ja": "それと……瑞希の撮影を、こっそり見学してました。\nボクが近くで見てたら、瑞希、やりにくいかと思って。", "zh": "还有……我偷偷去参观了瑞希的拍摄。\n要是我在旁边看着，瑞希可能会觉得不太好发挥。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0584_1010_006mak", "source_sha256": "ddb08d6846bd70b5fdfa3919029807f64392166329563c2d7e6ebb27774d0805", "ja": "瑞希、動きやセリフに本気がこもってて……\nボクも負けてられないなって！", "zh": "瑞希的动作和台词都倾注了真情实感……\n我也不能输给她！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0584_1011_p", "source_sha256": "cded1c616cfe5ce37c62695733c42351613066886f5717d66eb3aaa5d9fa12a3", "ja": "そうだったのか。\n瑞希から、いい刺激をもらったんだな。", "zh": "原来是这样啊。你从瑞希那里得到了很好的激励呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0584_1012_006mak", "source_sha256": "85187d82e036a665cafd5dc50b4609c1e36e29c64efe777b9d07ec1495ac4a91", "ja": "はい！　ボクが演じる真も、きっと同じ気持ち……\nううん、ボク以上にうれしかったのかなって。", "zh": "是的！我饰演的真一定也是同样的心情……\n不，我想，她可能比我还要高兴吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0584_1013_006mak", "source_sha256": "950f081bd65f4bbfa7a93c6569cd24986438a1fcf6e12937ec1ff6dc21757333", "ja": "心の底から、本気でぶつかれる相手に出会えたことが。\nお話の中の真は、飢えてましたから。", "zh": "因为遇见了能打从心底、全力以赴去碰撞的对手。\n毕竟故事里的真，一直都很渴望这样的对手。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0584_1014_006mak", "source_sha256": "312edfe10ed6700360893025e033aab6ecef3c38920d4e9300fb471aed476c52", "ja": "だから「瑞希をすごい！」って思う気持ちもあるけど、\n「絶対に負けたくない！」って対抗意識もあって……。", "zh": "所以，虽然我也有着“瑞希真厉害！”的想法，\n但同时也有着“绝对不想输给她！”的竞争意识……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0584_1015_006mak", "source_sha256": "9be2c76e94b837914aeafe6f30a96a4378c62103ea55a9ff4d0f59cc5520cc54", "ja": "そういうことを考えてたら、なんだかウズウズ\nしてきちゃって。早く、演じたくて仕方ないです！", "zh": "想着这些事情，不知怎么就开始坐立不安了。真想快点登台表演，已经等不及了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0584_1016_staff", "source_sha256": "e89de684e912160c544ef657197c5aa89a7a6592989a4c2314e5347234273f9e", "ja": "菊地真さん！　準備お願いしまーす！", "zh": "菊地真小姐！请做好准备——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0584_1017_006mak", "source_sha256": "67ed5e3fb75b8ec8948cf268e0c3f6704649245f456920adc969c225489fe358", "ja": "あっ、はーい！", "zh": "啊，来啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0584_1018_p", "source_sha256": "2f2e95121236d3d692c1ddea0e3c63fa159942e6557c51aadb640e0a5708ab1a", "ja": "出番みたいだな。\n真のその思い、演技にぶつけて来てくれ！", "zh": "看来该你上场了。把你的那份心意，尽情投入演技中吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0584_1019_006mak", "source_sha256": "8f543bbf80a20cbe5780ef6c320d791ac928b4d09571ce17c64d179c8648d8d6", "ja": "はい！　全力で向き合える相手がいるからこそ、\nボクも、真も、輝ける……。", "zh": "是！正因为有能够全力面对的对手，\n我和真才能绽放光芒……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0584_1020_006mak", "source_sha256": "f52313c7e20ef1078e7516aa98d1cf980a6acfc27c0fc31c95b721e9cbf03096", "ja": "瑞希に負けないように……いえ、勝つつもりで\nがんばります！　それじゃ、行ってきます！", "zh": "为了不输给瑞希……不，我是打算赢过她的，\n我会加油的！那么，我出发了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0584_1021_006mak", "source_sha256": "d27c57d9ccf42322b70082227af5529cb84d34b61fe99679f2824fa06598dbb6", "ja": "追いかけっこは、もう終わり？　なんだ、早いな～。\nでもまあ、準備運動のあとは……わかってるよね♪", "zh": "追逐游戏已经结束了吗？什么嘛，真快啊～。\n不过嘛，做完准备运动之后……你知道该做什么吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0584_1022_tekirejisutansu", "source_sha256": "aaccb1dbe414ec802f177ec5c371be87372d2955a66b7fdbe4ca430ca11cf38f", "ja": "ゼェー、ハアー……この、体力オバケめ……！\nだが人数はこっちが上だ！　お前ひとりで何ができる！", "zh": "呼……哈……你这体力怪物……！\n不过，我们这边人多！你一个人能做什么！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0584_1023_006mak", "source_sha256": "26e745b44784e1b5d317ce3d5fae796b0981edd1eeb1bc05c46870098671d675", "ja": "ボクがひとり？　あはははっ！　なに？　その冗談～。\nまあ、ボクだけでも乗り切れるけど……。", "zh": "我一个人？啊哈哈哈！什么啊，这玩笑～  \n不过，就算只有我也能撑过去……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0584_1024_006mak", "source_sha256": "17ceb87cdd2210e717f7cb03b5e4b850869c42dfb50c5d47b2060d03a1441edd", "ja": "せっかくだから、ボクのカワイイみんなを見せて\nあげるね。戦具……『変わり身ミック』！！", "zh": "机会难得，就让你看看我可爱的伙伴们吧。战具……『替身米克』！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
